msgstr "强制 openpilot 切换上线/离线状态。<br>（例如：用于更新）"

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/firehose.py:17
msgid ""
"For maximum effectiveness, bring your device inside and connect to a good "
"USB-C adapter and Wi-Fi weekly.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode can also work while you're driving if connected to a hotspot "
"or unlimited SIM card.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Frequently Asked Questions\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter how or where I drive? Nope, just drive as you normally "
"would.\n"
"\n"
"Do all of my segments get pulled in Firehose Mode? No, we selectively pull a "
"subset of your segments.\n"
"\n"
"What's a good USB-C adapter? Any fast phone or laptop charger should be "
"fine.\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter which software I run? Yes, only upstream openpilot (and "
"particular forks) are able to be used for training."
msgstr ""
"为了达到最佳效果，请将设备带到室内，每周连接优质 USB-C 充电器和 Wi-Fi。\n"
"\n"
"如果连接了热点或不限量流量卡，在行车过程中也可使用 Firehose 模式。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"常见问题\n"
"\n"
"我的驾驶方式或驾驶地点有影响吗？没有，像平时一样驾驶即可。\n"
"\n"
"在 Firehose 模式下，我的所有片段都会被拉取吗？不会，我们会选择性地拉取部分片段。\n"
"\n"
"什么样的 USB-C 充电器比较好？任何快充手机或笔记本充电器都可以。\n"
"\n"
"我运行什么软件有关系吗？有，只有上游的 openpilot（及特定分支）可用于训练。"

msgid "Adaptive Coasting Mode (ACM) reduces braking to allow smoother coasting when appropriate."
msgstr "自适应滑行模式 (ACM) 会在适当的时候减少制动，从而实现更平稳的滑行。"

msgid "Automatically switches personality to \"Aggressive\" below 30 km/h and restores your selected personality above 40 km/h."
msgstr "车速低于 30 公里/小时时，自动切换至‘激进’模式；车速高于 40 公里/小时时，恢复至您选择的模式。"

msgid "Lead Dist"
msgstr "前车距离"

msgid "Toyota ACC Click +5"
msgstr "Toyota ACC 点按 +5"

msgid "Modify ACC speed adjustment logic: when enabled, a single click adjusts speed by 5 (factory default requires a long press)."
msgstr "修改 ACC 调整速度逻辑：开启后，点按一次即可 +5 (原厂预设为长按 +5)。"
msgid "Use Lane Turn Desires (LTD)"
msgstr "启用低速转弯辅助 (LTD)"

msgid "If you're driving below the set speed and have your blinker on, the car will plan a turn in that direction at the nearest drivable path. This prevents situations (like at red lights) where the car might plan the wrong turn direction. From SunnyPilot."
msgstr "当车速低于设定值且打方向灯时，车辆将会在最近的可行驶路径上自动规划转弯。这可避免（如停红灯时）车辆规划错误的转弯方向。来自SunnyPilot"

msgid "Adjust Lane Turn Speed"
msgstr "转弯触发最高车速"

msgid "Set the maximum speed for lane turn desires (Default is 20 km/h)."
msgstr "设定触发自动转弯辅助的最高车速限制 (预设为 20 km/h)。"

msgid " km/h"
msgstr " km/h"

